# .dockerignore -- STATUS: PROPOSAL, 2026-11-05 (see .workerignore and
# traces/ignore_ladder_20261105/). Not read by any build yet.
#
# Everything .workerignore ignores (line for line, checked by scripts/ci/ignore_ladder.py), plus what
# a Docker image of the product does not need. Same restricted syntax as .workerignore.

